        // Whitelist: anything wired to a Bootstrap JS component (data-bs-toggle / target / dismiss /
        // slide) runs untouched — tabs, collapses, dropdowns, modals, offcanvas, carousels all
        // depend on the native click default being preserved. #fragment anchors run untouched too.
